        "created_at": "2017-03-15T13:59:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;Saw the Zealot, and then the Acolyote, and a few Voodoo Pins, but no relics and no problems. &nbsp;One late game Entry Point, and lots of beats from the heroes.</p>",
