        "id": 192106,
        "name": "robb8888",
        "username": "robb8888",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-15T16:53:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This team/environment combo worked so well that I tried it on the Spite/Skinwalker Gloomy Challenge Mode combo. &nbsp;Wiped the floor with them. &nbsp;The lack of environment destruction didn't matter much against Spite, who destroyed all of the environment cards right after they came out. &nbsp;All heroes above 20 HP except CC, who was taking fairly steady damage from Unflagging Animation.&nbsp;</p>",
