      {
        "id": 192112,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-18T14:24:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy mint, never saw any of the relics. Only real hickup was a Strength of the Grave that stuck around a couple turns before I got Naturalist into Gazelle form (I've taken for granted how easy it is to play those cards with Hunted). And even if the relics had come out, I had Lead from the Front and Next Evolution in play.</p><p>Honestly, I think I did more damage to myself with Proverbs and Axiums than Gloomy and his goons did, even with the Entry Points out.</p>",
